1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,708
Then, now and then, the chromosome number doubled.

2
00:00:02,708 --> 00:00:11,796
With thirty six, every chromosome had a partner again, and the plant was fertile: Raphanobrassica, a new allopolyploid.

3
00:00:11,796 --> 00:00:16,523
Sadly, it had the root of a cabbage and the leaves of a radish.

